  "limitations": [
    "Finite runs only; no unlimited-process stability or photographic-realism claim.",
    "NVML device activity includes desktop activity and is not kernel occupancy. Less tracing work can reduce utilization while increasing completed samples.",
    "CPU index preparation costs more CPU per room; worker count trades throughput for CPU and VRAM. Only 1, 2 and 4 workers measured for this implementation.",
    "Capture-only excludes file encoding and validation; CLI includes startup, lossless raw-sRGB tensors, Zstd, writes, metrics and shutdown, with up to 200 ms exit-observation delay.",
    "Motion inference, O-voxel export and multi-timestep performance not measured. Browser compilation checked, browser runtime not measured.",
    "Nsight trace had an event-processing overflow and is excluded from timing evidence.",
    "A broader use of SAH for probe relocation was rejected after image checks exposed changed solid classification. Final relocation invariants match every measured room.",
    "Benchmark build provenance is recorded verbatim. A regression test was added after that build; no production code changed thereafter."
  ],
